import sys

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Command tab: two full scalping charts (BTC-fixed + manual coin)
# Both get the SAME feature set as the Sniper chart: candles,
# EMA9/EMA21/VWAP overlays, auto Pivot Points (S/R) with proximity
# highlighting, candle-close countdown, timeframe buttons incl.
# 8h/1d, and the Multi-TF RSI strip. Built via one reusable
# createScalpChartWidget() factory (each instance keeps its own
# chart objects in a closure, no collisions between the two).
#
# Also declutters the Sniper chart's pivot lines: by default only
# Pivot/S1/R1 show a price-tag label; S2/S3/R2/R3 draw as plain
# thin lines and only gain a label when price is actually near
# them — fixes the overlapping-indicator-labels complaint. Chart
# heights increased for more breathing room.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

